# Small house — a sample .obj in the shape Blender exports
# (o groups, quads, vn/vt, mtllib + usemtl). Units are meters;
# Reblend scales by 100 on import, so the house is 200 cm wide.
mtllib house.mtl
o Walls
v -1.0000 -1.0000 0.0000
v 1.0000 -1.0000 0.0000
v 1.0000 1.0000 0.0000
v -1.0000 1.0000 0.0000
v -1.0000 -1.0000 2.0000
v 1.0000 -1.0000 2.0000
v 1.0000 1.0000 2.0000
v -1.0000 1.0000 2.0000
v -1.1000 -1.1000 2.0000
v 1.1000 -1.1000 2.0000
v 1.1000 1.1000 2.0000
v -1.1000 1.1000 2.0000
v 0.0000 0.0000 3.0000
vt 0.0000 0.0000
vt 1.0000 0.0000
vt 1.0000 1.0000
vt 0.0000 1.0000
vt 0.5000 1.0000
vn 0.0000 0.0000 -1.0000
vn 0.0000 0.0000 1.0000
vn 0.0000 -1.0000 0.0000
vn 0.0000 1.0000 0.0000
vn 1.0000 0.0000 0.0000
vn -1.0000 0.0000 0.0000
vn 0.0000 -0.6727 0.7399
vn 0.0000 0.6727 0.7399
vn 0.6727 0.0000 0.7399
vn -0.6727 0.0000 0.7399
usemtl WallMat
s off
f 1/1/1 4/4/1 3/3/1 2/2/1
f 5/1/2 6/2/2 7/3/2 8/4/2
f 1/1/3 2/2/3 6/3/3 5/4/3
f 4/1/4 8/4/4 7/3/4 3/2/4
f 2/1/5 3/2/5 7/3/5 6/4/5
f 1/1/6 5/4/6 8/3/6 4/2/6
o Roof
usemtl RoofMat
s off
f 9/1/7 10/2/7 13/5/7
f 11/1/8 12/2/8 13/5/8
f 10/1/9 11/2/9 13/5/9
f 12/1/10 9/2/10 13/5/10
